.TH ASPEN-SVC 8 "" "aspen-discovery" "Aspen Discovery"
.SH NAME
aspen-svc \- manage Aspen Discovery services via systemctl
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aspen-svc
.I command
.I site
.RI [ component ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A thin systemctl wrapper for a site's Aspen units.
.I command
is one of
.BR start ,
.BR stop ,
.BR restart ,
.BR status ,
.B enable
or
.BR disable .
With no
.I component
the command applies to the whole site (aspen@<site>.target).
The component
.B solr
addresses the site's Solr unit; any other component is a background
module name such as
.B koha_export
(dashes are accepted and normalized to underscores).
.B status
without a component lists all of the site's units.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aspen-list (8),
.BR aspen-sync-modules (8),
.BR systemctl (1)
